# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
# Keep secrets and scratch out of the build context. The security-proxy image
# COPYs only ali-bot/security-proxy/, so the rest of the (small, ~1.6M) submodule
# is harmless in the context. We deliberately do NOT try to negate-include a
# single subdir of ali-bot — `ali-bot/*` + `!ali-bot/security-proxy` is pruned by
# BuildKit and breaks the COPY — we only keep secrets and junk out.
.git
ali-bot/.git
.env
*.env
!.env.example
.make/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
